Private live terminal source attribution

Confctl remains GPL-3.0-only under the unchanged project LICENSE.txt.
Adapted finite sizing/cache rules: tty-screen 0.8.2 and io-console 0.9.4.
Invocation-owned console lifetime, omitted Readline/tput/stty providers,
reached family UTF-8 admission and cooperative resize error delivery are
explicit port differences, not native equivalence claims.

